          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हादरणे — hādarṇe — \"to shake; to be shaken\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भूकंपात आमचं संपूर्ण घर हादरलं. bhūkampāt āmcaṁ sampūrṇa ghar hādarlaṁ. Our whole house shook in the earthquake."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो हादरला, to hādarlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also of people: ती बातमी ऐकून तो हादरला, the news shook him."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हादरणे (hādarṇe) is a Marathi verb of violent shaking; its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
